          # `UninterpretedOption` are also appended to the interpreted option, which
          # deviates from the actual FileDescriptorProto path. E.g.:
          #   [ 4, 3, 7, 10101, 2 ]
          # refers to the option name `(my_opt)`, and:
          #   [ 4, 3, 7, 10101, 7 ]
